From bob at ccl.kuleuven.be  Sun Feb 12 10:27:33 2006
From: bob at ccl.kuleuven.be (Bert de Bruijn)
Date: Sun, 12 Feb 2006 11:27:33 +0100 (CET)
Subject: Next release of AlphaCore? JUST DO IT
In-Reply-To: <12778.1139707848@www005.gmx.net>
